    'office_more_pages_purpose' => 'Office pages are short now. The notes that used to sit on each page are here.',
    'office_more_pages_why' => 'On a page you seldom open, knowing the rule first prevents mistakes.',
    'office_more_pages_s1' => 'Applications: forms from the website and from market sales staff. Approving one creates the partner account and sends the joining steps.',
    'office_more_pages_s2' => 'For partners → Training: add videos, PDF guides and short articles. Partners see only what you publish. The quiz limit stops anyone guessing again and again to get a certificate.',
    'office_more_pages_s3' => 'For partners → Meetings: plan meetings and training sessions. When you publish one, the invited partners get a notice. Times are Bangladesh time.',
    'office_more_pages_s4' => 'For partners → Agreement: dealers and sub-dealers accept this in their panel. Every published version is kept, and you can see the newest version each partner accepted.',
    'office_more_pages_s5' => 'Dealers & sub-dealers → Area dealers: a dealer and an area dealer are the same person. The place code on the account is that dealer\'s sales area, and another dealer cannot use a code that is already held. Branch managers and other staff are not dealers.',
    'office_more_pages_s6' => 'Staff → Staff list: the Super Admin creates staff accounts and chooses what each person can do. Staff see only the pages and actions they have permission for.',
    'office_more_pages_s7' => 'Staff → Staff salary: check the saved agreement, target and earned bonus before you approve. Approved entries need a private receipt. Staff cannot pay an entry they approved themselves; the owner can.',
    'office_more_pages_s8' => 'Staff → Roles & permissions: make roles you can reuse. Permissions set for one staff member stay as they are when a role changes. Super Admin access is managed separately.',
    'office_more_pages_s9' => 'Reports → Branch sales: the order count includes approved, sent and delivered orders. Order value, money collected and profit count delivered goods only, and only the delivered part of a partly delivered order. Waiting, rejected and cancelled orders are left out.',
    'office_more_pages_s10' => 'Website → Customer reviews: approve a comment to show it in the reviews on the website. Website → Page text is the plain text of the information pages. For the homepage, use Arrange the website.',
